ader-20261014\\\"\\n  ],\\n  \\\"excluded_scope\\\": [\\n    \\\"aos-platform/apps/web\\\",\\n    \\\"aos-platform/services/aos-api/aos_api/aip_production_contract_store.py\\\",\\n    \\\"aos-platform/services/aos-api/aos_api/aip_task_store.py\\\",\\n    \\\"aos-platform/maintenance/qiyuehui-restored-data-volume\\\"\\n  ],\\n  \\\"expected_outputs\\\": [\\n    \\\"PlanPrime/RED/minimum standalone bounded readonly saved CreatorInternalWorkflowListResponse with original canonicalhash/typedDTO, same snapshot/tenant/headref/task provenance/privacy limits/trueempty/failure503; no legacywriters or originalDB effects\\\",\\n    \\\"Unitadjacent/nativeisolationquality then rootTask separately integrates only draftlistGET; preserve full231Goal/visual/install/business/budgetC final genuineuserapproval\\\"\\n  ],\\n  \\\"lease_expires_at\\\": \\\"2026-10-14T16:00:00+00:00\\\",\\n  \\\"status\\\": \\\"ACTIVE\\\",\\n  \\\"created_at\\\": \\\"2026-10-14T20:56:19+08:00\\\"\\n}\\nFILE .evidence/qyh-creator-workflow-bounded-reader-20261014/implementation-plan.md SHA256 c1867894a7ff8e95558244a07e5c9fa5ea15ea0a6064c792b32b3d055a8f8f8e\\n# 达人内部草稿专用有界只读投影方案\\n\\nRules：用户AGENTS方案先行、最小更改、保护data/dirty；231唯一m1串行/完整Loop/独立Prime精确冻结消费。同ownerTask/base2030/16:00UTC精确新模块/test/evidence；rootTask另持有router/http/D-wave，不修改共享AIP生产Store/TaskStore、原Creator execute/list/history或globalDTO。完整Goal/原安装全恢复授权/唯一真实审批者持续，读slice不是预算或业务批准。\\n\\n已复习产品v2达人五阶段/内部准备与外部触达分离、技术13的tenant/同cutoff/hash/PII最小披露/未知失败关闭、231全旅程与真实链要求；现前端PreparationPanel六purpose及13个字符串details字段。DDL w2_001 head/version/currentrevision/taskID及appendonlyrevision/RLSFORCE，原create/revise canonical_hash({briefType,schemaRef,spec})均已定位；原legacy列表全brief无LIMIT/defaultdbconnectreadwrite，因此新专用reader而非机械flipCatalog。\\n\\n新增 `services/aos-api/aos_api/ecommerce_creator_internal_workflow_readonly.py`、`services/aos-api/tests/test_ecommerce_creator_internal_workflow_readonly.py`。class CreatorInternalWorkflowReadonlyReader.list(scope)只用原connect_read_only(scope)，要求readonlyTrue/autocommitFalse/REPEATABLE_READ，一事务SELECT transaction_timestamp()作为DBcutoff；一个固定SELECT head LEFTJOIN scoped currentrevision及scopedtask，WHERE精确org/project+brief_type=creator_internal_workflow（或currentrevision缺失以免错误空态），不读取其他业务spec，不查Receipt/Run/Source，不Provider/ref解引用。\\n\\nSQL仅选head org/project/brief/task/currentrevision/version/updatedAt、revisionorg/project/brief/task/revision/type/schemaRef/spec/contentHash/lifecycle/createdAt、taskorg/project/taskID/task_type。只取匹配本head当前version，旧head不存在当前revision或task行不存在/outertenant drift均失败而非静默掉行。known canonical creator task type ecommerce.workshop.creator_internal_task由原execute CreateTaskRequest硬编码提供，SQLleftjoin验证，不改变旧legacy可能存在的非canonicalmanualbrief，但安装readonly不能把其他任务当此工作流。\\n\\n固定MAX_ROWS1000+LIMIT1001哨兵，ORDERrevision.createdAt DESC/briefID稳定，先识别行超限再purpose去重，不截断冒充完整。CASE spec+schemaRef JSON text总bytes<=64KiB才返回，逐行和所有源材料1MiB/finalDTO1MiB上限；超过任一限额CREATOR_WORKFLOW_READ_LIMIT_EXCEEDED，不回零成功。每行head/revision/task tenant、brief/taskID/currentrevision一致；整数revision/version>=1且version>=revision（freeze版本递增，不能要求相等）；head.updatedAt与revision.createdAt aware<=cutoff，revcreatedAt<=headupdatedAt；schemaRef原ResourceRef strictvalidate+精确EcommerceCreatorInternalWorkflow._schema_ref比较；lifecycle原BriefLifecycle enum可读，仅历史事实不推导运行许可；严格原typed TaskBriefRevision构建及original canonical_hash校验，不复制哈希算法。非法schema/hash/spec及任务来源漂移CREATOR_WORKFLOW_READ_AUTHORITY_DRIFT，连接/表/role/clock失败固定错误码，任一异常不空成功、错误不附SQL/数据/私密文本。\\n\\nspec由原内部workflow规定purpose/title/summary/details/status/externalEffectsAllowed及可选restoredFromRevision；外部标记必须False，purpose/status由原_require_creator_brief+typed输出验证。还需title2..160/summary2..2000，恢复revision正整数<currentrevision。privacy最小披露：details只允许现前端实际13字段(owner/productRef/productName/candidateSource/contentCategory/audienceScale/channel/budget/commission/benefits/deliverables/evidence/schedule)，字段值字符串<=2000；完整13字段已与前端values机械逐项核对。未列字段/嵌套对象不回给浏览器，整个读取显式CREATOR_WORKFLOW_READ_CONTENT_UNSUPPORTED，不静默丢弃伪造exact内容。原公共redact_sensitive对title/summary/details扫描；检测到原敏感合同会redact的字符串则显式CREATOR_WORKFLOW_READ_PRIVACY_UNAVAILABLE，不返回原文或改写后伪称原稿。该检测只覆盖已有公开secret规则，不能声称所有自由文本PII都自动审过；新内部展示仍依赖原安装role/markings/dataScope准入，无模型或外部发送。未知敏感字段failclosed，预算/佣金只是内部文本不能批准费用。\\n\\n复用原workflow._require_creator_brief和_draft不复制六purpose/四status/原ref状态机；按原最新createdAt/briefID排序，全部行先严格验证再每purpose保留首项，防被去重遮蔽坏旧行。响应沿用CreatorInternalWorkflowListResponse，仅当前授权保存草稿；真正全空返回items[]/count0，不合格任一源row明确unknown/error。此类无allowedCommands字段，不凭status approved、version或exactRef授予任何execute/人审/Provider/外发许可。\\n\\n测试RED missingmodule，再empty/nonempty sixpurpose/latestpurpose、同事务/role/readonly/isolation、outertenant/head/task drift/missingrevision+task/tasktype/hash/schema/spec/lifecycle/time/version/secret及unknowndetail拒绝、1000/1001/smallmanytotal/64KiBCASE NULL及finalsize，去重后坏旧行仍拒绝。累计旧workflow9、readCatalog/readHTTP、生产Brief现有邻域；真实owner隔离PG3表+FORCERLS/只SELECT角色/读写25006/并发snapshot，坏行与限额只在隔离fixture，原库不seed/造坏数据。之后codePrime exactsource/nativequality，rootTask另方案/Prime/RED只GET接线，最新已提交archive+freshAPI维护门+原真人GET/原菜单/原650/三视口Prime/准确Delivery/AuthorityPrime，再剩余helpers/fullC/自然链/安装/八场景/视觉/观察发布。\\n\\nFILE .evidence/qyh-creator-workflow-bounded-reader-20261014/proposed-reader.py.txt SHA256 baae1ede2cb0ed6594b7b8f89ca75e15f9b96141c565640340f70cfdb465b412\\n\\\"\\\"\\\"Saved creator preparation projection; never grants workflow execution.\\\"\\\"\\\"\\nfrom datetime import datetime\\n\\nimport psycopg\\nfrom psycopg import IsolationLevel\\n\\nfrom aos_api.aip_contracts import ResourceRef\\nfrom aos_api.aip_production_contract_store import canonical_hash\\nfrom aos_api.aip_production_contracts import TaskBriefRevision\\nfrom aos_api.db import connect_read_only\\nfrom aos_api.ecommerce_creator_internal_workflow import (\\n    EcommerceCreatorInternalWorkflow, CreatorInternalWorkflowError,\\n)\\nfrom aos_api.ecommerce_creator_internal_workflow_contracts import CreatorInternalWorkflowListResponse\\nfrom aos_api.public_contracts import redact_sensitive\\nfrom aos_api.tenant_scope import TenantScope\\n\\nMAX_ROWS = 1000\\nMAX_ITEM_BYTES = 64 * 1024\\nMAX_TOTAL_BYTES = 1024 * 1024\\n_DETAIL_KEYS = frozenset({\\n    'owner', 'productRef', 'productName', 'candidateSource', 'contentCategory',\\n    'audienceScale', 'channel', 'budget', 'commission', 'benefits',\\n    'deliverables', 'evidence', 'schedule',\\n})\\n_SPEC_KEYS = frozenset({'purpose', 'title', 'summary', 'details', 'status',\\n                        'externalEffectsAllowed', 'restoredFromRevision'})\\n\\n\\nclass CreatorWorkflowReadonlyError(RuntimeError):\\n    def __init__(self, code):\\n        self.code = code\\n        super().__init__(code)\\n\\n\\ndef _deny(suffix):\\n    raise CreatorWorkflowReadonlyError('CREATOR_WORKFLOW_READ_' + suffix)\\n\\n\\ndef _integer(value):\\n    return type(value) is int and value >= 1\\n\\n\\ndef _time(value, cutoff):\\n    return isinstance(value, datetime) and value.utcoffset() is not None and value <= cutoff\\n\\n\\nclass CreatorInternalWorkflowReadonlyReader:\\n    def __init__(self, *, connect_factory=None):\\n        self._connect = connect_factory or connect_read_only\\n\\n    @staticmethod\\n    def _rows(conn, scope):\\n        return conn.execute(\\n            f'''SELECT h.org_id AS head_org,h.project_id AS head_project,\\n                h.brief_id AS head_brief,h.task_id AS head_task,h.current_revision,\\n                h.version,h.updated_at AS head_updated,\\n                r.org_id,r.project_id,r.brief_id,r.task_id,r.revision,r.brief_type,\\n                r.content_hash,r.lifecycle,r.created_by,r.created_at,\\n                t.org_id AS task_org,t.project_id AS task_project,\\n                t.task_id AS linked_task,t.task_type,\\n                octet_length(r.spec::text)+octet_length(r.schema_ref::text) AS payload_bytes,\\n                CASE WHEN octet_length(r.spec::text)+octet_length(r.schema_ref::text)<={MAX_ITEM_BYTES}\\n                     THEN r.spec ELSE NULL END AS spec,\\n                CASE WHEN octet_length(r.spec::text)+octet_length(r.schema_ref::text)<={MAX_ITEM_BYTES}\\n                     THEN r.schema_ref ELSE NULL END AS schema_ref\\n                FROM aip_task_brief_head h\\n                LEFT JOIN aip_task_brief_revision r\\n                  ON r.org_id=h.org_id AND r.project_id=h.project_id\\n                 AND r.brief_id=h.brief_id AND r.revision=h.current_revision\\n                LEFT JOIN aip_task t\\n                  ON t.org_id=h.org_id AND t.project_id=h.project_id AND t.task_id=h.task_id\\n                WHERE h.org_id=%s AND h.project_id=%s\\n                  AND (r.brief_type=%s OR r.brief_id IS NULL)\\n                ORDER BY r.created_at DESC,h.brief_id LIMIT %s''',\\n            (*scope.key, 'creator_internal_workflow', MAX_ROWS + 1),\\n        ).fetchall()\\n\\n    @staticmethod\\n    def _draft(row, scope, cutoff):\\n        for org, project in [('head_org', 'head_project'), ('org_id', 'project_id'),\\n                             ('task_org', 'task_project')]:\\n            if (row[org], row[project]) != scope.key:\\n                _deny('AUTHORITY_DRIFT')\\n        if (row['head_brief'] != row['brief_id']\\n                or row['head_task'] != row['task_id']\\n                or row['linked_task'] != row['task_id']\\n                or row['task_type'] != 'ecommerce.workshop.creator_internal_task'\\n                or not all(_integer(row[k]) for k in ['revision', 'current_revision', 'version'])\\n                or row['current_revision'] != row['revision'] or row['version'] < row['revision']\\n                or not _time(row['created_at'], cutoff) or not _time(row['head_updated'], cutoff)\\n                or row['created_at'] > row['head_updated']):\\n            _deny('AUTHORITY_DRIFT')\\n        spec, schema = row['spec'], row['schema_ref']\\n        if type(spec) is not dict or type(schema) is not dict:\\n            _deny('AUTHORITY_DRIFT')\\n        if ResourceRef.model_validate(schema) != EcommerceCreatorInternalWorkflow._schema_ref():\\n            _deny('AUTHORITY_DRIFT')\\n        if row['content_hash'] != canonical_hash({\\n                'briefType': row['brief_type'], 'schemaRef': schema, 'spec': spec}):\\n            _deny('AUTHORITY_DRIFT')\\n        value = TaskBriefRevision(\\n            tenant=dict(orgId=scope.org_id, projectId=scope.project_id),\\n            brief_id=row['brief_id'], task_id=row['task_id'], revision=row['revision'],\\n            version=row['version'], brief_type=row['brief_type'], schema_ref=schema,\\n            spec=spec, content_hash=row['content_hash'], lifecycle=row['lifecycle'],\\n            created_by=row['created_by'], created_at=row['created_at'],\\n        )\\n        EcommerceCreatorInternalWorkflow._require_creator_brief(value)\\n        if set(spec) - _SPEC_KEYS:\\n            _deny('CONTENT_UNSUPPORTED')\\n        if not 2 <= len(spec['title']) <= 160 or not 2 <= len(spec['summary']) <= 2000:\\n            _deny('CONTENT_UNSUPPORTED')\\n        restore = spec.get('restoredFromRevision')\\n        if 'restoredFromRevision' in spec and (not _integer(restore) or restore >= row['revision']):\\n            _deny('AUTHORITY_DRIFT')\\n        details = spec.get('details', {})\\n        if (set(details) - _DETAIL_KEYS\\n                or any(type(v) is not str or len(v) > 2000 for v in details.values())):\\n            _deny('CONTENT_UNSUPPORTED')\\n        visible = {'title': spec['title'], 'summary': spec['summary'], 'details': details}\\n        if redact_sensitive(visible) != visible:\\n            _deny('PRIVACY_UNAVAILABLE')\\n        return EcommerceCreatorInternalWorkflow._draft(value)\\n\\n    def list(self, scope: TenantScope) -> CreatorInternalWorkflowListResponse:\\n        try:\\n            with self._connect(scope) as conn:\\n                if (conn.read_only is not True or conn.autocommit is not False\\n                        or conn.isolation_level != IsolationLevel.REPEATABLE_READ):\\n                    _deny('UNAVAILABLE')\\n                cutoff = conn.execute('SELECT transaction_timestamp() AS cutoff').fetchone()['cutoff']\\n                if not isinstance(cutoff, datetime) or cutoff.utcoffset() is None:\\n                    _deny('AUTHORITY_DRIFT')\\n                rows = self._rows(conn, scope)\\n                if len(rows) > MAX_ROWS:\\n                    _deny('LIMIT_EXCEEDED')\\n                total, items, seen = 0, [], set()\\n                for row in rows:\\n                    size = row['payload_bytes']\\n                    if type(size) is not int or size < 1:\\n                        _deny('AUTHORITY_DRIFT')\\n                    total += size\\n                    if size > MAX_ITEM_BYTES or total > MAX_TOTAL_BYTES:\\n                        _deny('LIMIT_EXCEEDED')\\n                    draft = self._draft(row, scope, cutoff)\\n                    if draft.purpose not in seen:\\n                        seen.add(draft.purpose)\\n                        items.append(draft)\\n                result = CreatorInternalWorkflowListResponse(\\n                    tenant=dict(orgId=scope.org_id, projectId=scope.project_id),\\n                    items=items, count=len(items),\\n                )\\n                if len(result.model_dump_json(by_alias=True).encode()) > MAX_TOTAL_BYTES:\\n                    _deny('LIMIT_EXCEEDED')\\n                return result\\n        except CreatorWorkflowReadonlyError:\\n            raise\\n        except psycopg.Error:\\n            _deny('UNAVAILABLE')\\n        except (ValueError, KeyError, TypeError, AttributeError, CreatorInternalWorkflowError):\\n            _deny('AUTHORITY_DRIFT')\\n\\nFILE .evidence/qyh-creator-workflow-bounded-reader-20261014/proposed-tests.py.txt SHA256 beaa1137e195fb5df7dabc11f00fb0f3ea18d03c3415bed894e6087279a78230\\n\\\"\\\"\\\"Synthetic authority rows are not genuine customer/human approvals.\\\"\\\"\\\"\\nimport copy\\nimport json\\nfrom contextlib import contextmanager\\nfrom datetime import datetime, timedelta, timezone\\n\\nimport psycopg\\nimport pytest\\nfrom psycopg import IsolationLevel\\n\\nfrom aos_api.aip_production_contract_store import canonical_hash\\nfrom aos_api.ecommerce_creator_internal_workflow import EcommerceCreatorInternalWorkflow\\nfrom aos_api.ecommerce_creator_internal_workflow_readonly import (\\n    CreatorInternalWorkflowReadonlyReader, CreatorWorkflowReadonlyError,\\n    MAX_ROWS, MAX_ITEM_BYTES, MAX_TOTAL_BYTES,\\n)\\nfrom aos_api.tenant_scope import TenantScope\\n\\nSCOPE = TenantScope('org-org', 'dev-project')\\nNOW = datetime(2026, 10, 14, tzinfo=timezone.utc)\\n\\n\\ndef row(*, purpose='outreach_batch', brief='brief-fixture', revision=1, version=1):\\n    spec = dict(purpose=purpose, title='内部准备', summary='整理内部合作条件',\\n                status='draft', details={'channel': '站内邀约'}, externalEffectsAllowed=False)\\n    schema = EcommerceCreatorInternalWorkflow._schema_ref().model_dump(mode='json', by_alias=True)\\n    value = dict(head_org=SCOPE.org_id, head_project=SCOPE.project_id, head_brief=brief,\\n                 head_task='creator-task-fixture', current_revision=revision, version=version,\\n                 head_updated=NOW, org_id=SCOPE.org_id, project_id=SCOPE.project_id,\\n                 brief_id=brief, task_id='creator-task-fixture', revision=revision,\\n                 brief_type='creator_internal_workflow', lifecycle='draft', created_by='fixture',\\n                 created_at=NOW, task_org=SCOPE.org_id, task_project=SCOPE.project_id,\\n                 linked_task='creator-task-fixture', task_type='ecommerce.workshop.creator_internal_task',\\n                 spec=spec, schema_ref=schema)\\n    return reseal(value)\\n\\n\\ndef reseal(value):\\n    value['content_hash'] = canonical_hash({\\n        'briefType': value['brief_type'], 'schemaRef': value['schema_ref'], 'spec': value['spec']})\\n    value['payload_bytes'] = len(json.dumps(value['spec'], ensure_ascii=False).encode()) + len(json.dumps(value['schema_ref']).encode())\\n    return value\\n\\n\\ndef snapshot(rows=(), *, readonly=True, isolation=IsolationLevel.REPEATABLE_READ, cutoff=NOW, fail=False):\\n    calls, connections = [], []\\n    class Result:\\n        def __init__(self, data): self.data = data\\n        def fetchone(self): return self.data[0]\\n        def fetchall(self): return self.data\\n    class Connection:\\n        read_only = readonly\\n        autocommit = False\\n        isolation_level = isolation\\n        def execute(self, sql, params=()):\\n            calls.append((sql, params))\\n            assert sql.startswith('SELECT ')\\n            if fail: raise psycopg.OperationalError('fixture connection failure')\\n            if 'transaction_timestamp' in sql: return Result([{'cutoff': cutoff}])\\n            assert 'LEFT JOIN aip_task_brief_revision' in sql and 'LEFT JOIN aip_task t' in sql\\n            assert 'r.brief_type=%s OR r.brief_id IS NULL' in sql\\n            assert 'CASE WHEN octet_length' in sql and 'LIMIT %s' in sql\\n            assert params == (*SCOPE.key, 'creator_internal_workflow', MAX_ROWS + 1)\\n            return Result(rows)\\n        def commit(self): pytest.fail('reader cannot mutate')\\n    @contextmanager\\n    def connect(scope):\\n        assert scope == SCOPE\\n        connections.append(scope)\\n        yield Connection()\\n    return CreatorInternalWorkflowReadonlyReader(connect_factory=connect), calls, connections\\n\\n\\ndef denied(rows, code, **options):\\n    reader, _, _ = snapshot(rows, **options)\\n    with pytest.raises(CreatorWorkflowReadonlyError) as error:\\n        reader.list(SCOPE)\\n    assert error.value.code == 'CREATOR_WORKFLOW_READ_' + code\\n    assert str(error.value) == error.value.code\\n\\n\\ndef test_empty_is_true_one_readonly_snapshot():\\n    reader, calls, connections = snapshot()\\n    result = reader.list(SCOPE)\\n    assert result.items == [] and result.count == 0\\n    assert len(calls) == 2 and connections == [SCOPE]\\n    assert result.tenant.org_id == SCOPE.org_id\\n\\n\\ndef test_all_six_purposes_and_latest_per_purpose_preserve_typed_exact_ref():\\n    purposes = ['candidate_import', 'outreach_batch', 'outreach_message',\\n                'collaboration', 'delivery_check', 'relationship_plan']\\n    rows = [row(purpose=p, brief='brief-' + p) for p in purposes]\\n    rows.append(row(brief='brief-older'))\\n    reader, _, _ = snapshot(rows)\\n    result = reader.list(SCOPE)\\n    assert result.count == 6\\n    assert [v.purpose for v in result.items] == purposes\\n    assert result.items[1].resource_id == 'brief-outreach_batch'\\n    assert result.items[1].content_hash == rows[1]['content_hash']\\n\\n\\n@pytest.mark.parametrize('field,value', [\\n    ('head_org', 'other'), ('head_project', 'other'), ('org_id', 'other'),\\n    ('project_id', 'other'), ('task_org', 'other'), ('task_project', 'other'),\\n    ('brief_id', 'other'), ('task_id', 'other'), ('linked_task', None),\\n    ('task_type', 'other'), ('current_revision', 2), ('revision', True),\\n    ('version', 0), ('version', True), ('created_at', NOW + timedelta(seconds=1)),\\n    ('head_updated', NOW - timedelta(seconds=1)), ('created_at', NOW.replace(tzinfo=None)),\\n    ('lifecycle', 'unknown'), ('content_hash', 'a' * 64), ('spec', None),\\n])\\ndef test_authority_drift_fails_before_any_success(field, value):\\n    item = row(); item[field] = value\\n    denied([item], 'AUTHORITY_DRIFT')\\n\\n\\ndef test_missing_current_revision_is_not_empty_success():\\n    item = row(); item.update(brief_id=None, payload_bytes=None, spec=None)\\n    denied([item], 'AUTHORITY_DRIFT')\\n\\n\\ndef test_bad_older_duplicate_is_not_hidden_by_latest_purpose():\\n    broken = row(brief='older'); broken['content_hash'] = 'b' * 64\\n    denied([row(), broken], 'AUTHORITY_DRIFT')\\n\\n\\n@pytest.mark.parametrize('change', [\\n    {'schema_ref': {'resourceType': 'Other', 'resourceId': 'other', 'revision': '1'}},\\n    {'spec': {'externalEffectsAllowed': True}}, {'spec': {'purpose': 'unknown'}},\\n    {'spec': {'status': 'unknown'}}, {'spec': {'restoredFromRevision': 1}},\\n])\\ndef test_rehashed_bad_contract_is_still_rejected(change):\\n    item = row()\\n    for key, value in change.items():\\n        if key == 'spec': item['spec'].update(value)\\n        else: item[key] = value\\n    reseal(item)\\n    denied([item], 'AUTHORITY_DRIFT')\\n\\n\\n@pytest.mark.parametrize('details', [{'password': 'fixture'}, {'channel': {'nested': 'fixture'}},\\n    {'owner': None}, {'channel': 'x' * 2001}])\\ndef test_unknown_or_nested_details_are_explicit_unavailable(details):\\n    item = row(); item['spec']['details'] = details; reseal(item)\\n    denied([item], 'CONTENT_UNSUPPORTED')\\n\\n\\n@pytest.mark.parametrize('text', ['Bearer fixture-token-123', 'fixture@example.test', '13800138000', 'sk-fixture123'])\\ndef test_known_sensitive_text_never_reaches_response(text):\\n    item = row(); item['spec']['details']['channel'] = text; reseal(item)\\n    denied([item], 'PRIVACY_UNAVAILABLE')\\n\\n\\n@pytest.mark.parametrize('options,code', [({'readonly': False}, 'UNAVAILABLE'),\\n    ({'isolation': IsolationLevel.READ_COMMITTED}, 'UNAVAILABLE'),\\n    ({'fail': True}, 'UNAVAILABLE'), ({'cutoff': NOW.replace(tzinfo=None)}, 'AUTHORITY_DRIFT')])\\ndef test_connection_or_clock_unknown_is_not_empty(options, code):\\n    denied([], code, **options)\\n\\n\\ndef test_row_bound_checks_all_rows_before_purpose_reduction():\\n    reader, _, _ = snapshot([row()] * MAX_ROWS)\\n    assert reader.list(SCOPE).count == 1\\n    denied([row()] * (MAX_ROWS + 1), 'LIMIT_EXCEEDED')\\n\\n\\ndef test_single_oversize_sql_null_guard_and_total_size_limit():\\n    item = row(); item.update(payload_bytes=MAX_ITEM_BYTES + 1, spec=None, schema_ref=None)\\n    denied([item], 'LIMIT_EXCEEDED')\\n    item = row(); item['payload_bytes'] = MAX_ITEM_BYTES\\n    denied([item] * (MAX_TOTAL_BYTES // MAX_ITEM_BYTES + 1), 'LIMIT_EXCEEDED')\\n\\n\\ndef test_valid_restore_and_freeze_version_are_readable_saved_facts_only():\\n    item = row(revision=3, version=4); item['spec'].update(status='approved', restoredFromRevision=1)\\n    item['lifecycle'] = 'frozen'; reseal(item)\\n    reader, _, _ = snapshot([item]); result = reader.list(SCOPE)\\n    assert result.items[0].revision == 3 and result.items[0].version == 4\\n    assert result.items[0].status == 'approved'\\n    assert 'allowedCommands' not in result.model_dump(by_alias=True)\\n\\nFILE services/aos-api/aos_api/ecommerce_creator_internal_workflow_contracts.py SHA256 560a8da03e75ab1bdad351ce5918d60cd3f48a1dfa8e5140cf06432f8571e33c\\n\\\"\\\"\\\"Contracts for the tenant-safe creator internal workflow.\\\"\\\"\\\"\\nfrom __future__ import annotations\\n\\nfrom typing import Any, Literal\\n\\nfrom pydantic import Field, model_validator\\n\\nfrom aos_api.aip_contracts import AipContractModel, TenantContext\\nfrom aos_api.aip_production_contracts import ExactRevisionRef\\n\\nCreatorWorkflowCommand = Literal[\\\"create\\\", \\\"save\\\", \\\"submit_review\\\", \\\"approve\\\", \\\"reject\\\", \\\"restore\\\"]\\nCreatorWorkflowPurpose = Literal[\\\"candidate_import\\\", \\\"outreach_batch\\\", \\\"outreach_message\\\", \\\"collaboration\\\", \\\"delivery_check\\\", \\\"relationship_plan\\\"]\\nCreatorWorkflowStatus = Literal[\\\"draft\\\", \\\"in_review\\\", \\\"approved\\\", \\\"rejected\\\"]\\n\\n\\nclass CreatorInternalWorkflowCommandRequest(AipContractModel):\\n    command: CreatorWorkflowCommand\\n    purpose: CreatorWorkflowPurpose\\n    title: str = Field(min_length=2, max_length=160)\\n    summary: str = Field(min_length=2, max_length=2000)\\n    details: dict[str, Any] = Field(default_factory=dict)\\n    draft_ref: ExactRevisionRef | None = None\\n    expected_version: int | None = Field(default=None, ge=1)\\n    restore_revision: int | None = Field(default=None, ge=1)\\n\\n    @model_validator(mode=\\\"after\\\")\\n    def _revision_contract(self) -> \\\"CreatorInternalWorkflowCommandRequest\\\":\\n        revising = self.command != \\\"create\\\"\\n        if revising != (self.draft_ref is not None and self.expected_version is not None):\\n            raise ValueError(\\\"revision commands require draftRef and expectedVersion\\\")\\n        if self.draft_ref and self.draft_ref.resource_type != \\\"TaskBriefRevision\\\":\\n            raise ValueError(\\\"draftRef must reference TaskBriefRevision\\\")\\n        if (self.command == \\\"restore\\\") != (self.restore_revision is not None):\\n            raise ValueError(\\\"restore requires restoreRevision and other commands forbid it\\\")\\n        return self\\n\\n\\nclass CreatorInternalWorkflowDraft(ExactRevisionRef):\\n    resource_type: Literal[\\\"TaskBriefRevision\\\"] = \\\"TaskBriefRevision\\\"\\n    version: int = Field(ge=1)\\n    purpose: CreatorWorkflowPurpose\\n    title: str\\n    summary: str\\n    details: dict[str, Any]\\n    status: CreatorWorkflowStatus\\n\\n\\nclass CreatorInternalWorkflowReceipt(AipContractModel):\\n    receipt_id: str\\n    operation: Literal[\\\"task_brief.create\\\", \\\"task_brief.revise\\\"]\\n    idempotency_key: str\\n    replay: bool\\n\\n\\nclass CreatorInternalWorkflowSideEffects(AipContractModel):\\n    provider_invocation_count: Literal[0] = 0\\n    external_outreach_count: Literal[0] = 0\\n    contract_signature_count: Literal[0] = 0\\n    business_mutation_count: Literal[0] = 0\\n\\n\\nclass CreatorInternalWorkflowCommandResponse(AipContractModel):\\n    tenant: TenantContext\\n    command: CreatorWorkflowCommand\\n    task_id: str\\n    draft: CreatorInternalWorkflowDraft\\n    receipt: CreatorInternalWorkflowReceipt\\n    side_effects: CreatorInternalWorkflowSideEffects\\n    message: str\\n\\n\\nclass CreatorInternalWorkflowHistoryResponse(AipContractModel):\\n    tenant: TenantContext\\n    items: list[CreatorInternalWorkflowDraft]\\n    count: int = Field(ge=0)\\n\\n\\nclass CreatorInternalWorkflowListResponse(AipContractModel):\\n    tenant: TenantContext\\n    items: list[CreatorInternalWorkflowDraft]\\n    count: int = Field(ge=0)\\n\\nFILE services/aos-api/alembic/versions/w2_001_brief_evidence.py SHA256 49bd74820e667cd0c9f1033525a00810d590ea07d5a04a12c6d0cb327125abfd\\n\\\"\\\"\\\"Add W2-A task brief and evidence bundle authority.\\n\\nRevision ID: w2_001\\nRevises: aip6_004\\nCreate Date: 2026-08-13\\n\\\"\\\"\\\"\\nfrom __future__ import annotations\\n\\nfrom collections.abc import Sequence\\nfrom alembic import op\\n\\nrevision: str = \\\"w2_001\\\"\\ndown_revision: str | Sequence[str] | None = \\\"aip6_004\\\"\\nbranch_labels = None\\ndepends_on = None\\n\\nTABLES = (\\\"aip_task_brief_revision\\\", \\\"aip_task_brief_head\\\", \\\"aip_evidence_bundle_revision\\\", \\\"aip_production_contract_receipt\\\")\\n\\n\\ndef _tenant_table(name: str) -> None:\\n    op.execute(f\\\"ALTER TABLE {name} ENABLE ROW LEVEL SECURITY\\\")\\n    op.execute(f\\\"ALTER TABLE {name} FORCE ROW LEVEL SECURITY\\\")\\n    op.execute(f\\\"\\\"\\\"CREATE POLICY tenant_scope_{name}_w2 ON {name} TO aos_runtime\\n        USING (org_id=NULLIF(current_setting('aos.org_id',true),'') AND project_id=NULLIF(current_setting('aos.project_id',true),''))\\n        WITH CHECK (org_id=NULLIF(current_setting('aos.org_id',true),'') AND project_id=NULLIF(current_setting('aos.project_id',true),''))\\\"\\\"\\\")\\n    op.execute(f\\\"GRANT SELECT,INSERT,UPDATE ON {name} TO aos_runtime\\\")\\n\\n\\ndef upgrade() -> None:\\n    op.execute(\\\"\\\"\\\"CREATE TABLE aip_task_brief_head (\\n      org_id TEXT NOT NULL, project_id TEXT NOT NULL, brief_id TEXT NOT NULL,\\n      task_id TEXT NOT NULL, current_revision BIGINT NOT NULL, version BIGINT NOT NULL DEFAULT 1,\\n      updated_at TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT NOW(),\\n      PRIMARY KEY(org_id,project_id,brief_id), CHECK(current_revision>=1), CHECK(version>=1),\\n      FOREIGN KEY(org_id,project_id,task_id) REFERENCES aip_task(org_id,project_id,task_id))\\\"\\\"\\\")\\n    op.execute(\\